# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. The pipeline reads this file itself; it never
# exports, prints or logs the values (`doctor` shows only whether a key is present).
#
# Needed only for the Hindi house voice (ElevenLabs Adam on eleven_v4). English videos use
# the free edge-tts voice and need no key at all. A key with only the Text-to-Speech
# permission is enough. Each Hindi character costs about one credit; a 10-minute
# episode's Hindi narration is roughly 7,000-10,000 credits.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
